  m_text: 'This story contains graphic violence, blood and gore, death, strong language, and psychological horror.


    This is <color=#B32D2E><b>PART I : DAY ZERO</b></color> of an episodic survival series.

    The choices you make, the people you save, and the humanity you lose will carry over into future installments.


